// Title: Raccine Uninstall
// Rule ID: a31eeaed-3fd5-478e-a8ba-e62c6b3f9ecc
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_disable_raccine.yml
//
